Metrics: actual projection/reset seam in same process and thread, five equal repeats per input/arm. Paused before polling, GET and widget construction; release protocol checked separately.
Columns: tier ops variant case repaints provider_bytes name_bytes typed_model_selections resets logical_owned_string_calls logical_owned_string_bytes successful_allocator_calls requested_allocator_bytes.
Allocator includes successful alloc/alloc_zeroed/realloc calls and new requested bytes (not allocation lifetimes, peak/RSS or timing). Empty strings have logical conversions but zero physical allocation.
Reset cases include unchanged session-copy work in allocator counters even though logical owned-string columns count provider/name only.
